{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 43, :comments ["<b>And you shall not defile yourselves by them, and you shall not be made detestable by them, for I am YHWH your Elohim, and you shall sanctify yourselves.</b> Do not defile yourselves by them, so that you become impure and detestable through them — and this will occur through eating them. For since I am your Elohim, I desired that you become sanctified and prepare yourselves toward holiness."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:05.776596451Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}